"><div dir=3D"auto" class=3D"body markup"><p>As 2025 comes to a close, I wa=
nt to look back at some of the year=E2=80=99s most important developments i=
n large language models, reflect on the limitations and open problems that =
remain, and share a few thoughts on what might come next.</p><p>As I tend t=
o say every year, 2025 was a very eventful year for LLMs and AI, and this y=
ear, there was no sign of progress saturating or slowing down.</p><h1 class=
