cture and pre-training compute, my list would look like this:</p><ul><li><p=
><strong>2022 RLHF + PPO</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>2023 LoRA SFT</str=
ong></p></li><li><p><strong>2024 Mid-Training</strong></p></li><li><p><stro=
ng>2025 RLVR + GRPO</strong></p></li></ul><p>Pre-training is still the requ=
ired foundation for everything. Besides that, RLHF (via the PPO algorithm) =
was, of course, what brought us the original ChatGPT model in the first pla=
ce back in 2022.</p><p>In 2023, there was a lot of focus on LoRA and LoRA-l=
ike parameter-efficient fine-tuning techniques to train small custom LLMs.<=
