1><p>When it comes to LLM architectures, state-of-the-art models still use =
the good old decoder-style transformer. However, this year, open-weight LLM=
s more or less converged on using mixture-of-experts (MoE) layers, as well =
as at least one =E2=80=9Cefficiency-tweaked=E2=80=9D attention mechanism: G=
rouped-query attention, sliding-window attention, or multi-head latent atte=
ntion.</p><p>Beyond those fairly standard LLM architectures, we have also s=
een more drastic efficiency tweaks targeting the attention mechanism to sca=
le linearly with sequence length. Examples of this include the Gated DeltaN=
ets in Qwen3-Next and Kimi Linear, as well as the Mamba-2 layers in NVIDIA=
=E2=80=99s Nemotron 3.</p><p><span>Anyways, I don=E2=80=99t want to go into=
