/p></li><li><p><a href=3D"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/getting-star=
ted/intro">MCP</a><span> (</span><a href=3D"https://www.linuxfoundation.org=
/press/linux-foundation-announces-the-formation-of-the-agentic-ai-foundatio=
n">joining the Linux Foundation</a><span>) has already become the standard =
for tool and data access in agent-style LLM systems (for now); I expected t=
he ecosystem to remain more fragmented in 2025, until at least 2026.</span>=
</p></li></ol><h2 class=3D"header-anchor-post"><strong>9.2 Predictions for =
2026</strong><div class=3D"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc=
-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent"><div class=3D"pencraft pc=
-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA"><div id=3D"=C2=A792-predictions=
-for-2026" class=3D"pencraft pc-reset header-anchor offset-top"></div><butt=
on type=3D"button" aria-label=3D"Link" data-href=3D"https://magazine.sebast=
ianraschka.com/i/182789318/92-predictions-for-2026" class=3D"pencraft pc-re=
set pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M butt=
onStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o" tabindex=3D"0"><sv=
g xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width=3D"18" height=3D"18" viewBox=
=3D"0 0 24 24" fill=3D"none" stroke=3D"currentColor" stroke-width=3D"2" str=
